---
import StackCesar from '../components/home/stackCesar.astro';
import { ArrowRight } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section id="about" class="relative w-full border-b border-gray-800 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="bg-[#0d1117] absolute top-0 left-0 z-20 rounded-br-md border-r border-b border-gray-800 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-xs tracking-wider uppercase">
    <span class="lang-en">ABOUT</span><span class="lang-es">SOBRE MÍ</span>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row lg:h-auto">
    <!-- Left side - Content -->
    <div class="relative flex-1 md:flex-[0.6] px-4 py-20 md:px-12 lg:py-12 h-full">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h2 style="line-height: 1.2;" class="text-3xl font-bold md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up mb-6">
          <span class="lang-en">Bringing ideas to life</span><span class="lang-es">Dando vida a las ideas</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-8 opacity-0 animate-fade-in animation-delay-200">
          <div class="h-1 bg-white" style="width: 60px;"></div>
          <div class="h-1 bg-white/60" style="width: 30px;"></div>
          <div class="h-1 bg-white/30" style="width: 15px;"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Content paragraphs -->
        <div class="space-y-6 text-white/70 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-0 animate-fade-in animation-delay-300">
          <div class="group relative border-l-2 border-white/20 pl-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white">
            <div class="absolute -left-1.5 top-2 h-3 w-3 rotate-45 border-2 border-white/40 bg-[#0d1117] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-white"></div>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-en">I started out in <span class="text-white font-medium">mechanical design</span>, which taught me to think in systems and build things that actually work. From there I moved into <span class="text-white font-medium">UI/UX and interface design</span>, and that eventually led me into <span class="text-white font-medium">full-stack development</span> — where I've spent the last <span class="text-white font-medium">10+ years</span> building distributed, high-performance products end-to-end with React, TypeScript and Node.js, plus deep experience in AWS, scalable databases and deployment automation.</span>
              <span class="lang-es">Empecé en el <span class="text-white font-medium">diseño mecánico</span>, que me enseñó a pensar en sistemas y a construir cosas que realmente funcionan. De ahí pasé al <span class="text-white font-medium">diseño UI/UX y de interfaces</span>, y eso me llevó al <span class="text-white font-medium">desarrollo full-stack</span>, donde llevo más de <span class="text-white font-medium">10 años</span> construyendo productos distribuidos y de alto rendimiento de punta a punta con React, TypeScript y Node.js, además de experiencia profunda en AWS, bases de datos escalables y automatización de despliegues.</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="group relative border-l-2 border-white/20 pl-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white">
            <div class="absolute -left-1.5 top-2 h-3 w-3 rotate-45 border-2 border-white/40 bg-[#0d1117] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-white"></div>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-en">At <span class="text-white font-medium">RealXpertAI</span> I built an AI-powered real estate SaaS from scratch: conversational voice agents (Gemini Live, OpenAI Realtime), a distributed scraper for <span class="text-white font-medium">700,000+ listings</span>, and a semantic search engine that cut response times from 5 minutes to <span class="text-white font-medium">200 ms</span>.</span>
              <span class="lang-es">En <span class="text-white font-medium">RealXpertAI</span> construí desde cero un SaaS inmobiliario con IA: agentes de voz conversacionales (Gemini Live, OpenAI Realtime), un scraper distribuido para más de <span class="text-white font-medium">700.000 listados</span> y un motor de búsqueda semántica que redujo los tiempos de respuesta de 5 minutos a <span class="text-white font-medium">200 ms</span>.</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="group relative border-l-2 border-white/20 pl-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white">
            <div class="absolute -left-1.5 top-2 h-3 w-3 rotate-45 border-2 border-white/40 bg-[#0d1117] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-white"></div>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-en">At <span class="text-white font-medium">Hacking HR</span> I led architecture for scalable React/TypeScript/Node platforms, shipped 20+ products including The AIx Summit, and reduced AWS costs by <span class="text-white font-medium">50%</span> while improving load times by 40%.</span>
              <span class="lang-es">En <span class="text-white font-medium">Hacking HR</span> lideré la arquitectura de plataformas escalables en React/TypeScript/Node, entregué más de 20 productos —incluyendo The AIx Summit— y reduje los costos de AWS en un <span class="text-white font-medium">50%</span> mientras mejoraba los tiempos de carga en un 40%.</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="group relative border-l-2 border-white/20 pl-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white">
            <div class="absolute -left-1.5 top-2 h-3 w-3 rotate-45 border-2 border-white/40 bg-[#0d1117] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-white"></div>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-en">I'm happiest as the <span class="text-white font-medium">sole developer</span> in small teams, owning the whole lifecycle from concept and UI design to deployment and maintenance. I love learning constantly, and as a hobby I explore <span class="text-white font-medium">hardware, robotics and computer vision</span>.</span>
              <span class="lang-es">Disfruto más trabajando como <span class="text-white font-medium">único desarrollador</span> en equipos pequeños, a cargo de todo el ciclo: desde el concepto y el diseño de interfaz hasta el despliegue y el mantenimiento. Me encanta aprender constantemente y, como hobby, exploro <span class="text-white font-medium">hardware, robótica y visión por computadora</span>.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class="mt-10 opacity-0 animate-fade-in animation-delay-500">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/584247224217"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm transition-all duration-300 bg-white text-black hover:bg-white/90 hover:scale-105 h-12 px-8 border-2 border-white font-medium"
          >
            <span class="lang-en">Let's Work Together</span><span class="lang-es">Trabajemos juntos</span>
            <ArrowRight class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right side - Profile Card (placeholder) -->
    <StackCesar variant="web"/>
  </div>
</section>
